{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"dumbstruck-wonderful-xiphosuran","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\nThe RCA for broadish-permanent-condor found seven additional pytest fixtures that return a full `dict(os.environ)` directly or nested inside a rendered fixture value. Under pytest default long tracebacks, early ambient credentials can be printed verbatim through function-argument `saferepr`. Confirmed locations: `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_materialize_probe.py`, `test_autodeploy_fetch_secrets.py`, `test_autodeploy_disk_pressure.py`, `test_autodeploy_health_gate.py`, `test_autodeploy_signals_gerrit_config.py`, `test_observability_exit.py`, and `tests/interfaces/facades/test_cli.py`.\n\n## Plan\n- Build a parametrized real-pytest RED oracle using insertion-ordered synthetic sentinels and deterministic failures for each fixture surface.\n- Replace broad ambient copies with the minimal required environment for each harness while preserving explicit per-test mutations.\n- Prove every sentinel is absent, existing suites remain green, and the exact broad-copy mutation returns the oracle to RED.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Each listed fixture has a deterministic RED failure-rendering probe.\n- [ ] No listed fixture returns arbitrary ambient values.\n- [ ] Synthetic sentinel values are absent from default pytest failure output on every surface.\n- [ ] Existing fixture consumers retain required PATH and explicit environment behavior.\n- [ ] Focused suites, lint, and typecheck pass.","id":"3402-7143-2e14-4d1a","parent_id":"fc43-3c50-ec6c-4a3e","priority":1,"tags":["security","tests"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Prevent sibling pytest fixtures from rendering ambient credentials"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787022382255242001,"uuid":"808dca14-3382-467a-9ab9-880d8ef2c9a4"}